# Android release signing key -- this is the one credential Google Play uses
# to trust app updates as coming from you. It must never be committed; losing
# it isn't recoverable (Play won't let you re-key an existing listing), and
# leaking it lets anyone impersonate your app updates.
android_keystore/
export_credentials.cfg
wf_v084/android_keystore/
wf_v084/export_credentials.cfg
build/
*.pck
*.exe
*.aab
*.apk
